      "jcr:created": "Wed Jan 29 2025 19:20:08 GMT+0000",
      "text": "Trevo Trak® 21 Microcatheter Making a difference by going distal with ease You want a microcatheter that confidently gets you to the clot and helps simplify the procedure. The Trevo Trak 21 Microcatheter delivers all sizes of Trevo NXT ProVue Retriever for thrombectomy procedures. It’s designed to help you reach distal neurovasculature with its extra-long 162cm length, while providing support for aspiration catheters. This .021in ID microcatheter is compatible with all Trevo NXT sizes while maintaining a low clot crossing profile. Contact us X Trevo Trak® 21 | Stryker Product specifications and compatibility Techniques and portfolio Contact us Product specifications and compatibility Simplified compatibility Delivery of all Trevo NXT ProVue Retriever sizes simplifies compatibility. Specifications Length Inner diameter Distal outer diameter Proximal outer diameter 162 cm 0.021 in 2.4 F (0.031 in) 2.7 F (0.035 in) Compatibility Recommended usage with Trevo NXT Trevo NXT 3x32 Trevo NXT 4x28 Trevo NXT 4x41 Trevo NXT 6x37 Techniques and portfolio Easy distal navigation Highly trackable microcatheter designed for the combination technique. Combination techniques A) Trevo NXT ProVue Retriever B) Trevo Trak 21 Microcatheter C) AXS Catalyst 7 Distal Access Catheter D) FlowGate2 Balloon Guide Catheter E) AXS Vecta 74 Intermediate Catheter F) AXS Infinity LS Plus Long Sheath Contact us",
